sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: AP2 failure: unresolved_constraint and fallback to human present
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: AP2 failure: unresolved_constraint and fallback to human present. 4 participants: User, Shopping Agent, Trusted Surface, and Merchant. 7 steps, 5 crossing a trust boundary, 1 failure branch. Based on ap2 v0.2 (2026-04-28). Step 1: Shopping Agent to Merchant: Token plus open and closed Checkout Mandates. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Merchant to Merchant: Evaluate every constraint. Step 3: Merchant to Shopping Agent: Checkout Receipt: status Error, unresolved_constraint. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Shopping Agent to Trusted Surface: Fall back: request approval of closed Mandate Content. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Trusted Surface to User: Show the exact checkout authenticate. If The user declines: The purchase stops the open mandate remains bounded by its exp. Step 6: Trusted Surface to Shopping Agent: User-signed closed mandates. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 7: Shopping Agent to Merchant: Present the user-signed closed Checkout Mandate. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_user as User
  participant p_sa as Shopping Agent
  participant p_ts as Trusted Surface
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  p_sa->>p_merchant: Token plus open and closed Checkout Mandates
  Note over p_sa,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_merchant->>p_merchant: Evaluate every constraint
  p_merchant->>p_sa: Checkout Receipt: status<br/>Error, unresolved_constraint
  Note over p_merchant,p_sa: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_sa->>p_ts: Fall back: request approval<br/>of closed Mandate Content
  Note over p_sa,p_ts: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_ts->>p_user: Show the exact checkout#59; authenticate
  else The user declines
    Note over p_ts,p_user: The purchase stops#59; the open mandate remains bounded by its exp.
  end
  p_ts->>p_sa: User-signed closed mandates
  Note over p_ts,p_sa: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_sa->>p_merchant: Present the user-signed closed Checkout Mandate
  Note over p_sa,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
